        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>习题 11.1</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  body {\n    background: #fdf3f3;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 764px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fbe9e7 0%, #fdf4f2 45%, #ffffff 100%);\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 40px 46px 20px 46px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .chapter-bar {\n    background: linear-gradient(to right, #f0c9c0, #fbe6e0);\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #8a4b3c;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 22px;\n  }\n  .chapter-bar .num {\n    color: #c98b6b;\n    font-weight: normal;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #6b3a2e;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0b9ad;\n    padding-bottom: 3px;\n    margin: 18px 0 12px 0;\n  }\n  .item {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n    padding-left: 14px;\n  }\n  .sub {\n    padding-left: 34px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #c9a49a;\n    color: #a07a70;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n  }\n  .fig-caption {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .fig-center {\n    width: 260px;\n    margin: 6px auto 2px auto;\n  }\n  .tri-row {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    width: 360px;\n    margin: 8px auto 0 auto;\n  }\n  .tri-row .cell {\n    width: 108px;\n  }\n  .tri-row .cell .placeholder {\n    height: 62px;\n  }\n  .q4-wrap {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .q4-left {\n    flex: 0 0 250px;\n  }\n  .q4-right {\n    flex: 0 0 200px;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n  .q4-right .placeholder {\n    height: 78px;\n  }\n  .fill {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    width: 62px;\n  }\n  .fill-short {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    width: 40px;\n  }\n  .choices {\n    padding-left: 34px;\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 2.1;\n  }\n  .choices .row {\n    display: flex;\n  }\n  .choices .row span {\n    width: 150px;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 26px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #cfcfcf;\n    padding-top: 6px;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .footer .pg {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    margin-right: 12px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"chapter-bar\">习题 <span class=\"num\">11.1</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">复习巩固</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">1．图中有几个三角形？用符号表示这些三角形．</div>\n\n  <div class=\"fig-center\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\" style=\"height:78px;\">[Diagram: 三角形图，顶点 A 上方，底边 B D E C：centered]</div>\n    <div class=\"fig-caption\">（第 1 题）</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">2．长为 10，7，5，3 的四根木条，选其中三根组成三角形，有几种选法？为什么？</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">3．对于下面每个三角形，过顶点 $A$ 画出中线、角平分线和高．</div>\n\n  <div class=\"tri-row\">\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 三角形 (1)]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">（1）</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 三角形 (2)]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">（2）</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 三角形 (3)]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">（3）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"fig-caption\" style=\"width:360px;margin:2px auto 0 auto;\">（第 3 题）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"q4-wrap\" style=\"margin-top:16px;\">\n    <div class=\"q4-left\">\n      <div class=\"item\">4．如图，在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AE$ 是中线，$AD$ 是角平分线，$AF$ 是高．填空．</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">（1）$BE=$<span class=\"fill\"></span>$=\\dfrac{1}{2}$<span class=\"fill-short\"></span>；</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">（2）$\\angle BAD=$<span class=\"fill\"></span>$=\\dfrac{1}{2}$<span class=\"fill-short\"></span>；</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">（3）$\\angle AFB=$<span class=\"fill\"></span>$=90^\\circ$；</div>\n      <div class=\"sub\">（4）$S_{\\triangle ABC}=$<span class=\"fill\"></span>．</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"q4-right\">\n      <div class=\"placeholder\">[Diagram: 三角形 ABC，顶点 A，底边 B E D F C，含中线、角平分线、高：right]</div>\n      <div class=\"fig-caption\">（第 4 题）</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">5．选择题．</div>\n  <div class=\"sub\">下列图形中有稳定性的是（　　）．</div>\n  <div class=\"choices\">\n    <div class=\"row\"><span>（A）正方形</span><span>（B）长方形</span></div>\n    <div class=\"row\"><span>（C）直角三角形</span><span>（D）平行四边形</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-title\">综合运用</div>\n\n  <div class=\"item\">6．一个等腰三角形的一边长为 6 cm，周长为 20 cm，求其他两边的长．</div>\n  <div class=\"item\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;\">7．（1）已知等腰三角形的一边长等于 5，一边长等于 6，求它的周长；</div>\n  <div class=\"sub\" style=\"padding-left:44px;\">（2）已知等腰三角形的一边长等于 4，一边长等于 9，求它的周长．</div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\"><span class=\"pg\">8</span>第十一章　三角形</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
